<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56189" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατωφερ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάτω φερόμενος</span>
			, <i>hanging down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεφαλή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					5.30
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφερής</span>
			); <i>steep</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάβασις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.54.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. θέσις</span>
			<i>sloping</i> posture, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.60
			</span></i>; <i>descending</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελώνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orib.
					49.4.51
				</span></i>
			; <i>with a downward tendency, heavy</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στοιχεῖα</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνωφερής</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.175
			</span></i>, al., cf. Herm ap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				386.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρμή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					603.39
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ρῶς</span> Vett.
				Val.<i><span class="en">
				153.4
			</span></i>; 
				gloss on 
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατωκάρα</span>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				152
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>prone to vice, lewd</i>, 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφερής</span>
			 in Apollod.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.281f
			</span></i>, cf. Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				18.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				451.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. εἰς τὰ ἀφροδίσια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαλαβακχώ</span>
			.</div>
